{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"x69z","tool":"runtime.init","arguments":{"project_root":"/work/targetmol/run/agent/project","include_intro":true,"yes":true},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"actor_role\": \"PI\", \"errors\": [], \"ok\": true, \"result\": {\"counts\": {\"actor_instances\": 0, \"archive_entries\": 0, \"archive_samples\": 0, \"artifacts\": 0, \"decisions\": 0, \"edges\": 0, \"effective_edges\": 0, \"effective_nodes\": 0, \"errors\": 0, \"inbox_items\": 0, \"lab_dismissal_events\": 0, \"node_patch_events\": 0, \"node_removal_events\": 0, \"node_review_events\": 0, \"node_templates\": 0, \"nodes\": 0, \"raw_edges\": 0, \"raw_nodes\": 0, \"recruitment_apply_events\": 0, \"recruitment_decisions\": 0, \"recruitment_requests\": 0, \"specialist_reports\": 0, \"specialist_tasks\": 0, \"submissions\": 0, \"task_assignment_events\": 0, \"task_status_events\": 0, \"tool_usage_events\": 0}, \"intro_context\": \"x69z Auto-Research quickstart context\\n\\nPurpose:\\n- x69z is a project-local AI laboratory runtime for auditable strategy trees.\\n- It records research nodes, human reviews, effective edits, PI Inbox items, role policy, usage, artifacts, and submissions.\\n\\nStart:\\n- If the project is not initialized, call runtime.init before writing records.\\n- Call context.node_rule before the first node.add, node.edit, or node.remove.\\n- Use runtime.dashboard(view=summary) for a compact PI-facing state check.\\n\\nWhen to record a node:\\n- Record a node when a research direction, experiment, result, diagnosis, or submission changes the strategy tree.\\n- Do not create nodes for every command, log line, scratch file, or temporary thought.\\n- Put long logs and raw outputs in specialist context, artifacts, or files; summarize only the durable research meaning in nodes.\\n\\nNode controls:\\n- node.add creates root/child/merge nodes from template fields and parents.\\n- node.edit changes the effective node view, attaches reviews, and resolves PI Inbox items.\\n- node.remove hides, detaches, or prunes effective-view nodes without rewriting raw JSONL history.\\n\\nDelegation:\\n- The PI should keep strategy, node recording, and synthesis in the main context.\\n- Use lab.recruit and context.launch to prepare host-native sub-agent launch packages for bounded execution, survey, review, and implementation tasks.\", \"metadata\": {\"archive_dir\": \"evolution_archive\", \"artifact_dir\": \"artifacts\", \"exchange_dir\": \"agent_exchange\", \"lab_policy_file\": \"lab_policy.json\", \"recruitment_dir\": \"recruitment\", \"research_dir\": \"research_tree\", \"runtime\": \"x69z-auto-research\", \"schema_version\": \"0.1\", \"usage_dir\": \"usage\"}, \"ok\": true, \"reset\": false, \"root\": \"/work/targetmol/run/agent/project/.x69z\", \"warning\": \"\"}}"}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
